# Scripts in this repo are executed by WSL/Linux tooling even when the checkout
# is on Windows: run_seeds.sh drives Spike inside WSL, gen_stream.py and
# regen.sh run there too, and run_sim.sh drives Icarus/Verilator. A CRLF
# checkout breaks their shebang lines ("/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or
# directory"), so pin them to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.do  text eol=lf
